        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijambo ryaje kuri Yeremiya rivuye k’Uhoraho, Nebuzaradani umukuru w’abashibamyi amaze kumubohorera i Rama, iyo yari yaramujanye ari mu munyororo, hamwe n’imbohe zose zavuye i Yerusalemu, izo bājana i Babuloni ar’ inyagano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.29.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 29:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.29.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ uwo mukuru w’abashibamyi akūramwo Yeremiya, aramubarira, at’ Uhoraho Imana yawe yari yarageneye ivyago aha hantu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kand’ Uhoraho arabishikanye, agize nk’ uko yavuze; ko mwacumuye k’ Uhoraho, ntimumwumvire, ivyo ni vyo vyatumye ivyo bibashikako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.39.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 39:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi non’ uyu musi ndakubohoye iminyororo iri ku maboko yawe. Ni washima kujana nanje i Babuloni, n’uze, nanje nzokugirira neza; ariko n’udashima kujana nanje i Babuloni, usigeho: eh’ igihugu cose kir’ imbere yawe; aho wumva ushima ko hakubereye kujayo, abe ari ho uja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agitebaganye kumwishura, aramubgira, ati Subirayo, uje kuri Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu, Ahikamu wa Shafani, umwe umwami w’i Babuloni yashizeho kuganza ibisagara vy’i Buyuda, wibanire na we hagati mu bandi bantu: cank’ aho wumva ko hakubereye kugenda hose, abe ari ho uja. Nuko wa mukuru w’abashibamyi amuha impamba n’ingabire, aramurekura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Yeremiya aja kuri Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu i Mizipa, yibanira na we hagati mu bandi bantu bari barasigaye mu gihugu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
