            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.41.1+JER.41.2+JER.41.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 41:1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.42.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "42:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baza kuri Gedaliya i Mizipa. Ni bo aba: Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya, na Yohanani na Yonatani bene Kareya, na Seraya mwene Tanehumeti, na bene Efayi w’i Netofati, na Yezaniya umwana w’Umunyamayakati, bo n’ingabo zabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu, Ahikamu wa Shafani, ababarira abarahira, bo n’ingabo zabo, ati Ntimutinye gusaba Abakaludaya: mwibere mu gihugu, musabe umwami w’i Babuloni, kandi bizobaroranira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.52.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 52:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanje rāba ngerereye i Mizipa, kugira ngo nshikirweko n’Abakaludaya mu vyo bazombarira vyose, ni baza ino: ariko mweho, mwamure inzabibu za vino n’ivyo ibiti vyama na elayo z’amavuta, mubishire mu mibindi yanyu, mwibere mu bisagara vyanyu mwegukiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N’ Abayuda bose n’uko, abār’ i Mowabu no mu Bamoni no muri Edomu, n’abāri mu bihugu vyose, bumvise yuk’ umwami w’i Babuloni yaretse amasigarira yo mu Bayuda, kandi ko yashizeho Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu, Ahikamu wa Shafani, kubaganza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.43.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 43:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nukw Abayuda bose baragaruka, bavuye ahantu hose aho bari barirukaniwe, bashika mu gihugu c’i Buyuda, baza kuri Gedaliya i Mizipa, bamura inzabibu za vino n’ivyo ibiti vyama vyinshi cane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
